# Merfolk Cave-Diver {2}{U}, 2/4: "Whenever a creature you control explores, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn" (CR 701.44a, 603.2, 611.2).
# Black Lotus pays for the Diver. A Cenote Scout then explores a land (the Island goes to Bot1's hand): the Diver is a 3/4 that can't be blocked. A second Scout explores
# a nonland (the Lightning Bolt, left on top, drawn on turn 3; the Scout is a 2/2): each explore is its own trigger, so the Diver is a 4/4. The effects end with the turn, the Diver is a 2/4 and blockable again.

